            "note": "Graded high on the figures of the date: every figure is plain. Fine dark strokes, one line, lower panel upright. Six figures run together without separators, 25 10 22. All six are plain; the two 2s at the end match the 2 that opens the line. No roll number or name in this crop."
           }
          ]
         }
